    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Consumer AI: 97 days after launch, no help articles"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Press release and blog, June 15: Voice AI, Agentic Commerce, Register Co-Pilot and Consumer Pulse. Help-center search on Sep 20 returns zero articles for each name. The nav still badges it “🚀 new”."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "One feature, three states on three official surfaces"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Aug 27 release note says chain admins “now have a single Mobile App area”; the September monthly update leads with it as shipped."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "One product, five spellings"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Marketing site: “E-Commerce”. Status page: “Dutchie Ecommerce”. Help center: “Dutchie E-Commerce”. Footer: “E-commerce”. Status incident: “Ecomm”, “E-Comm”. A product-name dictionary is the cheapest check in the gate."
    },
